title: "HydroStream V2.1: EA Legacy and Current API Water Quality Pipeline"
type: software
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/DomaniqueBridglalsingh/analysis-ready-wastewater-datasets"
url: "https://github.com/DomaniqueBridglalsingh/analysis-ready-wastewater-datasets/releases/tag/v2.1.0"
abstract: >-
  HydroStream constructs reproducible, analysis-ready water-quality datasets
  from Environment Agency legacy annual CSV exports and current Water Quality
  Explorer/API CSV exports using a validated source cutover, reviewed unit
  harmonisation, source-identity-safe deduplication, and auditable QA outputs.
